{"strongs": "H3774", "word": "כְרֵתִי", "translit": "ke.re.ti", "root": "כרש", "morph": "N:N--TG", "pos": "adjective, of a people", "gloss": "Kerethites", "definition": "כְרֵתִי adjective, of a people , always with article, or plural, as substantive, Kerethites , a name for Philistines or a part of them (perhaps = Cretans , compare ᵐ5 Zeph 2:5 ; Ezek 25:15 on Crete as original home of Philistines, see כַּפְתֹּר , פְּלִשְׁתִּי ); — הַכְּרֵתִי = substantive collective; — ׳ נֶגֶב הַכּ 1Sam 30:14 (compare Dr ; ᵐ5 B Ξολθει , ᵐ5 L Ξορρι A Ξερηθει ); of soldiers of David's guard, וְהַפְּלֵתִי ׳ הַכּ 2Sam 8:18 (read ׳ עַלהַֿכּ Th We Dr and others) = 1Chr 18:17 ; 2Sam 15:18 ; 2Sam 20:7 + v 2Sam 20:23 Qr ( > Kt הכרי ), 1Kgs 1:38 ; 1Kgs 1:44 ( ᵐ5 Ξελεθθει , Ξερεθθει , etc.); plural כְּרֵתִים Ezek 25:16 (|| פְּלִשְׁתִּים ; ᵐ5 . Κρῆτας ); גּוֺי כְּרֵתִים Zeph 2:5 ( ᵐ5 Κρητῶν ; || ארץ פלשׁתים ): in v Zeph 2:6 We reads כֶּרֶת = Philistia (see [ כָרָה ], below I. כרה ). כֶּשֶׂב , כִּשְׂבָּה see כֶבֶשׂ etc.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4220')\">BDB4220</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3774')\">H3774</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4219')\">BDB4219</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4221')\">BDB4221</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>כְרֵתִי</bdbheb> <b>adjective, of a people</b>, always with article, or plural, as substantive, <highlightword>Kerethites</highlightword>, a name for Philistines or a part of them (perhaps = <highlight>Cretans</highlight>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <ref ref=\"Zeph 2:5\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(36,2,5)\">Zeph 2:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 25:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,25,15)\">Ezek 25:15</ref> on <highlight>Crete</highlight> as original home of Philistines, see <bdbheb>כַּפְתֹּר</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>פְּלִשְׁתִּי</bdbheb>); — <bdbheb>הַכְּרֵתִי</bdbheb> = substantive collective; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נֶגֶב הַכּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 30:14\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(9,30,14)\">1Sam 30:14</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('B')\"><reflink>B</reflink></lookup> <grk>Ξολθει</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup> <grk>Ξορρι</grk> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('A')\"><reflink>A</reflink></lookup> <grk>Ξερηθει</grk>); of soldiers of David's guard, <bdbheb>וְהַפְּלֵתִי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַכּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:18\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,18)\">2Sam 8:18</ref> (read <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַלהַֿכּ</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('The')\">Th</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> and others) = <ref ref=\"1Chr 18:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,18,17)\">1Chr 18:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:18\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,18)\">2Sam 15:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:7\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,7)\">2Sam 20:7</ref> + v<ref ref=\"2Sam 20:23\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,23)\">2Sam 20:23</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> ( &gt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>הכרי</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:38\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,38)\">1Kgs 1:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:44\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,44)\">1Kgs 1:44</ref> (<lo